  "synopsis": "Stephen Strange, a renowned neurosurgeon, gets into a serious car accident that leaves him unable to use his hands. This puts an end to his career. He seeks every possible way to heal, but it is all in vain. Until one day he meets a man who tells him about a place where the disabled were able to heal completely. He spends his last savings to go to a place called Kamar-Taj. There, he is informed that he must learn magic to fix his situation. Stephen does not believe in this, but eventually agrees. Thus begins his journey to become a magician, one who will be forced to face the dark side of magic and save Earth from the invasion of a being from another dimension known as Dormammu.",
